# Needs the dev test stock (TST). UI only: opens the Invest dialog, no trade.
name the Invest dialog's Share value chart is drawn in the Stock Monitor style over the vanilla graph
show-buy TST
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulShareChart
expect-text FinanceOverhaulShareChartFrom days ago
expect-text FinanceOverhaulShareChartTo today
expect-text FinanceOverhaulShareChartAxis-0 ₡
expect-no-overflow
capture share-chart-dialog
show-buy IDX
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulShareChart
capture share-chart-dialog-idx
cleanup:
close-dialog
